n, sumber asas dan bahan","- sediakan peralatan","- lakukan kerja-kerja mencampurkan dan menggaul bahan menggunakan kaedah manual atau mesin","- lakukan kerja-kerja pemeraman anaerobic","- lakukan kerja-kerja pengeringan","- lakukan kerja-kerja menghancurkan dan membungkus","- simpan hasil baja","- rekod"]],["9.4. Penstoran hasil baja organik dan kompos",["Pengetahuan","i. Pengenalan stor","● Tujuan","· Ciri-ciri","· Lokasi","· Kaedah penyusunan","ii. pembungkusan dan perlabelan","● Faedah","● Bahan","● Peralatan","● Kaedah","Amali","- asing mengikut jenis baja","- pastikan suhu dan cahaya terkawal","- pastikan pengudaraan mencukupi","- label dan bungkus baja mengikut jenis dan kuantiti"]],["9.5. Pasaran hasil baja kompos dan baja organik",["Pengetahuan","i. pengenalan pasaran","● Tujuan","● Kaedah","ii. promosi dan pengiklanan","iii. rekod","● Format","● Tarikh","● Lokasi","● Kuantiti","● Ulasan","Amali","- tentukan lokasi pasaran","- tentukan permintaan pasaran","- lakukan promosi","- tentukan logistik","- jual hasil","- rekod"]]]]]}